---
id: homemade-latte
title: Homemade Latte
category: breakfast

yield:
  servings: 1
  cooked_g: 275

storage:
  fridge_days: 1
  freezer_friendly: false

---

Froth @partly-skimmed-milk-2pct{1%cup} until silky with a thin layer of foam and pour into a large mug.

Grind whole beans with a #coffee-bean-grinder and pull a single shot of @lavazza-super-crema{1%shot} with an #espresso-machine over the frothed milk, then stir.
